cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SURD, please cite the paper below (preferred-citation)."
type: software
title: "SURD: Synergistic-Unique-Redundant Decomposition of causality"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-30
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ALD-Lab/SURD"
url: "https://github.com/ALD-Lab/SURD"
abstract: >-
  Python package that measures the information that past observations of a
  set of variables carry about the future of a target variable and decomposes
  it into redundant, unique and synergistic contributions, together with the
  causality leak from unobserved variables.
keywords:
  - causality
  - causal inference
  - information theory
  - synergy
  - redundancy
  - time series
